nd there are also some who  believe 11 might actually be his  daughter sure she's able to sniff out  files that make her believe she's Jane  the long-lost daughter of another  telekinetic woman whose daughter was  stolen but hoppers the one who had those  files hidden in his house wouldn't it be  something if the reason he was  transferring so much protective fatherly  energy to 11 is that she actually is his  own flesh and blood  stranger things have happened career  paths there's no doubt that Steve was  the surprise MVP of season 2 what's next  for the former pretty boy bully remains  to be seen  his entire post graduation plans seem to  revolve around Nancy Wiest no longer  with he spent the whole season subbing  in as a big brother slash babysitter for  Dustin and the other kids so now some  are drawing parallel lines between his  art and that of chief hopper considering  the fact that Hopper has no one he can  trust with all this sensitive  information about the other side in his  own squad perhaps he'll recruit Steve to  join the force and become as new deputy  the only real question is whether he'd  be allowed to maintain his signature  mane while in uniform very nice dish the  upside down as far as we know the upside  down is a parallel dimension that was  accidentally open by all those  government experiments gone wrong and  now that Elevens worked her supreme  magic the gate is closed but what if  there's more to it than that we know  from the last shot for the fight against  the mine flare is far from done but what  if instead of fighting a parallel world  this is a battle against the future the  upside down is characterized by images  of a Hawkins ravaged by destruction  decay and rot perhaps instead of seeing  some second dimension what's trickling  into the scene is a dreadful sense of  inevitability that's itching to come  true now the mind flare maybe some  Terminator style time traveler who's  ready to take over the town and possibly  the world sooner rather than later new  spies season two of stranger things sees  the show's new Big Bad the mine flare  possess will buyers and turn him into  his spy we still know very little about  this monster but his possession of will  at least gave us a few answers as to how  he functions the most important tidbit  contact with him could have lingering  effects namely in regards to his ability  to spy on our world through those he's  touched given this a few fans seem to  think that he's already found his next  set of eyes while exploring the tunnels  beneath Hawkins both hopper and Dustin  discover a weird object on the wall that  shoots a strange substance onto them  they clean it off in short order and  little as set of it past that but the  duffer brothers aren't the kind of show  runners to introduce something like that  if it isn't gonna pay off later this has  led many to believe that Dustin and  hopper are now infected by the mine  flare and will perhaps act as his new  spies fast-forward the time jump between  seasons 1 and 2 of stranger things was  roughly one year but many fans posit  that the show will jump forward even  further in future seasons considering  how quickly the child stars are aging  might not be too unreasonable to expect  the series to bypass the  one year mark and take them straight  into highschool in season three if so  that put the show near the tail end of  the decade and open up a whole new  strain of cinematic callback potential  think the fly and terminator in the Lost  Boys if they wait long enough to launch  production on a third season they could  very well hop into the next decade the  90s and start throwing out homages to  sci-fi picks of that era like the abyss  and tremors in Jurassic Park  it could happen spinoff the seventh  episode of stranger things 2 is left a  lot of viewers divided over whether 11  really even needed to venture out to  Chicago to link up with her lost  institution sister collie who bears the  number 8 on h